          "text": "Mental status examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Tired and mildly dishevelled, but caring for baby appropriately; cooperative and tearful. Mood described as “really low and anxious”; affect congruent and anxious. Thought process coherent. Oriented, with good insight and judgement."
      }
    },
